  "historyNote": "#2748, eff 6-14-84; ss by #4205, eff 1-15-87; ss by #4810, eff 5-1-90; ss by #5554 eff 1-15-93, EXPIRED: 1-15-99 New. #7228, eff 3-31-00; amd by #7627, eff 2-1-02; ss by #9113, INTERIM, eff 3-25-08, EXPIRES: 9-21-08; ss by #9240, eff 8-23-08; ss by #10386, eff 7-24-13; ss by #12014, eff 10-25-16; ss by #12014, eff 10-25-16; ss by #13250, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 8-6-21; ss by #13332, eff 1-25-22",
